{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/DirectoryConfig"]]},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","title":"groupMappings","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK15DirectoryConfigV13groupMappingsSayAA12GroupMappingVGvp","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"groupMappings"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK12GroupMappingV","text":"GroupMapping"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/DirectoryConfig\/groupMappings"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"groupMappings"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GroupMapping","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK12GroupMappingV","text":"GroupMapping"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}]}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The group-mapping table (D-30): which directory groups put a user into which AXIAM"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"groups. Empty means no directory group maps to anything, and a sign-in then removes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"every directory-sourced membership the user held."}],"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/directoryconfig\/groupmappings"]}],"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/DirectoryConfig/groupMappings":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"groupMappings"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK12GroupMappingV","text":"GroupMapping"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"title":"groupMappings","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/directoryconfig\/groupmappings","abstract":[{"text":"The group-mapping table (D-30): which directory groups put a user into which AXIAM","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"groups. Empty means no directory group maps to anything, and a sign-in then removes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"every directory-sourced membership the user held.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/DirectoryConfig\/groupMappings"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/DirectoryConfig":{"title":"DirectoryConfig","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/DirectoryConfig","abstract":[{"text":"A tenant’s directory configuration, as stored and as read back. Carries no secret: see the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"module documentation.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/directoryconfig","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DirectoryConfig","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DirectoryConfig","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management)."}],"title":"AxiamSDK"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/GroupMapping":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/groupmapping","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"GroupMapping"}],"abstract":[{"text":"One row of the group-mapping table (G-3, T23.3.4, D-30): a directory group, named by its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"distinguished name, and the AXIAM group a member of it is put into. ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The table is the only"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"way a directory group reaches an AXIAM group."}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" There is no match by name, no prefix or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"wildcard, and no AXIAM group is ever created from a directory one: a directory administrator","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"who names a group ","type":"text"},{"code":"admins","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" gains nothing unless a tenant administrator mapped it here. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"DN is stored as the administrator typed it and compared after RFC 4514 normalisation","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(","type":"text"},{"code":"axiam_directory::dn","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), so ","type":"text"},{"code":"CN=Staff, OU=Groups","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"cn=staff,ou=groups","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" are the same row.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"One DN may map to several AXIAM groups; the same (DN, group) pair twice is refused as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"redundant.","type":"text"}],"title":"GroupMapping","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"GroupMapping"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/GroupMapping"}}}